Third-party notices
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Code inside src/:

- The grain hash in src/photoreal/effects.js (prHash) is Dave Hoskins' "Hash without
  Sine" (hash12), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2014 David Hoskins.
  https://www.shadertoy.com/view/4djSRW

Libraries this block imports (installed by npm, not copied here; each keeps its own licence):

- postprocessing by Raoul van Rüschen (pmndrs), zlib License.
  https://github.com/pmndrs/postprocessing
- n8ao by N8python. Its package.json says ISC; the LICENSE file in the package is
  CC0 1.0 Universal. Both are permissive; we record both.
  https://github.com/N8python/n8ao
- three.js, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2010-2026 three.js authors. https://threejs.org

Assets the demo loads at runtime (not stored in this folder):

- Poly Haven HDRI "kloofendal_48d_partly_cloudy_puresky" and texture "asphalt_04",
  CC0 1.0 (public domain). https://polyhaven.com

Techniques described in published papers, written from scratch: percentage-closer soft
shadows (Fernando, NVIDIA 2005), interleaved gradient noise (Jimenez 2014), Vogel disk
sampling, box-projected (parallax-corrected) cube maps, Henyey-Greenstein scattering,
the thin-lens depth-of-field formulas.
